§§ `Section 8B -- Remedies relating to unreasonable denial of re-employment and dismissal without just cause or excuse`

-- "may at any time after any conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5)": the conciliation is read as the one the
-- Commissioner conducted, and the time as running from its conclusion.  Where the Commissioner conducted none, the
-- subsection does not say when the time begins (fork F13).
-- src:756 | 8B.—(1) An employee who has a re-employment dispute with his
-- src:757 | or her employer which relates to any matter referred to in
-- src:758 | section 8A(4)(a) or (b), or an employee (being an employee who
-- src:759 | attains the specified age on or after 1 January 2012) who considers
-- src:760 | that he or she has been dismissed without just cause or excuse by his
-- src:761 | or her employer on or after the date the employee attains the specified
-- src:762 | age, may at any time after any conciliation conducted pursuant to
-- src:763 | section 8A(5), make representations in writing to the Minister to be
-- src:764 | re-employed.
@ref s 8B(1) (src:756-764)
GIVEN `the employee has a re-employment dispute relating to a matter referred to in section 8A(4)(a) or (b)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the employee attained the specified age on or after 1 January 2012 and considers that he or she was dismissed without just cause or excuse on or after the date the employee attained it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the date the representations are made` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 8B(1) the employee may make representations in writing to the Minister to be re-employed` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the employee has a re-employment dispute relating to a matter referred to in section 8A(4)(a) or (b)` OR `the employee attained the specified age on or after 1 January 2012 and considers that he or she was dismissed without just cause or excuse on or after the date the employee attained it`)
    THEN
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the grant is for an employee with a re-employment dispute "which relates to any matter referred to in section 8A(4)(a) or (b)", or one "who considers that he or she has been dismissed without just cause or excuse by his or her employer on or after the date the employee attains the specified age"
        NOTHING
    ELSE
        CONSIDER `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded`
        -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection runs from "any conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5)"; none was conducted, and the text does not say what then governs (fork F13)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
        WHEN JUST concluded THEN
            IF `the date the representations are made` AT LEAST concluded
            THEN JUST TRUE
            ELSE
                -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the grant is "at any time after" the conciliation; the date is before it concluded
                NOTHING

-- src:766 | (2) Any representations to the Minister under subsection (1) must
-- src:767 | be made no later than one month after the conclusion of any
-- src:768 | conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5).
@ref s 8B(2) (src:766-768)
GIVEN `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 8B(2) the last day on which the employee can make representations to the Minister` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded`
    -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the time runs from "the conclusion of any conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5)"; none was conducted, and the text does not say what then governs (fork F13)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST concluded THEN JUST (`add months` concluded 1)

@ref s 8B(2) (src:766-768)
GIVEN `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the date the representations are made` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 8B(2) the representations were made in time` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 8B(2) the last day on which the employee can make representations to the Minister` `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST deadline THEN
        IF `the date the representations are made` AT MOST deadline
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE
            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Any representations to the Minister under subsection (1) must be made no later than one month after the conclusion of any conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5)" -- marginal reading (a)
            JUST FALSE

-- The clock starts on the day the conciliation concluded (day 0).
@ref s 8B(2) (src:766-768)
GIVEN `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
`s 8B(2) the employee must make written representations to the Minister within one month after the conclusion of the conciliation` MEANS
    PARTY Employee
    MUST `make written representations to the Minister to be re-employed`
    WITHIN (Day (`add months` `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded` 1) MINUS Day `the date the conciliation conducted pursuant to section 8A(5) concluded`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Employee BECAUSE "s 8B(2): representations were not made to the Minister within one month after the conclusion of the conciliation"

